<selectionEntry id="smoke-unit-568" name="Eldrad Ulthran" hidden="false" type="unit"><profiles><profile id="smoke-568-modelstats-0" name="Eldrad Ulthran" hidden="false" typeId="stat-11e0" typeName="Units"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="m-11e0">7"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="t-11e0">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="sv-11e0">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="Inv" typeId="inv-11e0">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="w-11e0">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="ld-11e0">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="oc-11e0">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="smoke-568-ability-diviner-of-futures" name="Diviner of Futures" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">At the start of your Command phase, if this model is on the battlefield, you gain 1CP.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="smoke-568-ability-doom-psychic-" name="Doom (Psychic)" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">At the end of your Movement phase, select one enemy unit within 18" of and visible to this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a friendly AELDARI model makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Wound roll.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="smoke-568-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Infantry, Character, Epic Hero, Psyker, Farseer, Eldrad Ulthran, Aeldari</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">Asuryani</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="smoke-568-rule-leader" name="Leader" hidden="false"><description>Before the battle, in the Muster Armies step, for each leader and support unit in your army, you can select one friendly bodyguard unit that unit can lead. That unit will then lead that bodyguard unit for the battle and form an attached unit with it. Unless otherwise stated, each bodyguard unit can only have one leader unit and one support unit attached to it.</description></rule><rule id="smoke-568-rule-battle-focus-faction-" name="Battle Focus (Faction)" hidden="false"><description>If your Army Faction is Asuryani, at the start of each battle round you receive Battle Focus tokens: Incursion 2, Strike Force 4, Onslaught 6. Spend tokens to enable eligible Agile Manoeuvres; unused tokens expire at the end of the battle round. Consult the full faction rule for manoeuvre triggers and effects.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="smoke-category-568" name="Epic Hero" targetId="smoke-cat-0" primary="true" hidden="false" /></categoryLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="smoke-568-model-0" name="Eldrad Ulthran" hidden="false" type="model"><constraints><constraint id="smoke-568-min-0" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" type="min" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="smoke-568-max-0" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" type="max" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="smoke-568-equipment-0-0" name="Mind War" hidden="false" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint id="smoke-568-equipment-0-0-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="smoke-568-equipment-0-0-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="smoke-568-weapon-0-0" name="Mind War" hidden="false" typeId="fd-ranged-type" typeName="Ranged Weapons"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd-rng">18"</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="fd-rna">1</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="fd-rbs">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="fd-rs">5</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="fd-rap">-2</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="fd-rd">D6</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="smoke-568-equipment-0-1" name="Shuriken pistol" hidden="false" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint id="smoke-568-equipment-0-1-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="smoke-568-equipment-0-1-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="smoke-568-weapon-0-1" name="Shuriken pistol" hidden="false" typeId="fd-ranged-type" typeName="Ranged Weapons"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd-rng">12"</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="fd-rna">1</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="fd-rbs">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="fd-rs">4</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="fd-rap">-1</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="fd-rd">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="smoke-568-equipment-0-2" name="Staff of Ulthamar and witchblade" hidden="false" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint id="smoke-568-equipment-0-2-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="smoke-568-equipment-0-2-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="smoke-568-weapon-0-2" name="Staff of Ulthamar and witchblade" hidden="false" typeId="fd-melee-type" typeName="Melee Weapons"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd-mrng">Melee</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="fd-ma">3</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="fd-mws">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="fd-ms">5</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="fd-map">-1</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="fd-md">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntry></selectionEntries><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="pts-11e0" value="120" /></costs></selectionEntry>
<selectionEntry id="smoke-unit-582" name="Farseer" hidden="false" type="unit"><profiles><profile id="smoke-582-modelstats-0" name="Farseer" hidden="false" typeId="stat-11e0" typeName="Units"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="m-11e0">7"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="t-11e0">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="sv-11e0">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="Inv" typeId="inv-11e0">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="w-11e0">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="ld-11e0">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="oc-11e0">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="smoke-582-ability-fates-psychic-" name="Branching Fates (Psychic)" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">While this model is leading a unit, once per phase, you can change the result of one Hit roll, one Wound roll or one Damage roll made for a model in that unit (excluding Support Weapon models) to an unmodified 6.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="smoke-582-ability-guide-psychic-" name="Guide (Psychic)" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">At the end of your Movement phase, select one enemy unit within 18" of and visible to this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a friendly AELDARI model makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Hit roll. Each unit can only be selected for this ability once per turn.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="smoke-582-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Infantry, Character, Aeldari, Psyker, Farseer</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">Ynnari, Asuryani</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="smoke-582-rule-leader" name="Leader" hidden="false"><description>Before the battle, in the Muster Armies step, for each leader and support unit in your army, you can select one friendly bodyguard unit that unit can lead. That unit will then lead that bodyguard unit for the battle and form an attached unit with it. Unless otherwise stated, each bodyguard unit can only have one leader unit and one support unit attached to it.</description></rule><rule id="smoke-582-rule-battle-focus-faction-" name="Battle Focus (Faction)" hidden="false"><description>If your Army Faction is Asuryani, at the start of each battle round you receive Battle Focus tokens: Incursion 2, Strike Force 4, Onslaught 6. Spend tokens to enable eligible Agile Manoeuvres; unused tokens expire at the end of the battle round. Consult the full faction rule for manoeuvre triggers and effects.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="smoke-category-582" name="Character" targetId="smoke-cat-1" primary="true" hidden="false" /></categoryLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="smoke-582-model-0" name="Farseer" hidden="false" type="model"><constraints><constraint id="smoke-582-min-0" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" type="min" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="smoke-582-max-0" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" type="max" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="mul-582-staff" name="Melee Wargear" hidden="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="mul-582-staff-witchblade"><constraints><constraint id="mul-582-staff-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="mul-582-