2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="ld-11e0">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="oc-11e0">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000000593-ability-1" name="Bladestorm" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">Ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit have the [SUSTAINED HITS 1] ability while targeting an enemy unit within half range.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000000593-ability-2" name="Shimmershield" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">The bearer has a 4+ invulnerable save.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000000593-ability-3" name="Aspect Shrine Token" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">Once per battle for each Aspect Shrine token this unit has, you can change the result of one Hit roll or one Wound roll made for a model in this unit (excluding CHARACTER models) to an unmodified 6.

Designer’s Note: Place an Aspect Shrine token next to the unit for each Aspect Shrine token it has, removing one each time this ability is used.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000000593-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Dire Avengers, Aspect Warriors, Grenades, Aeldari, Infantry</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">Ynnari, , Asuryani</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="source-000000593-starting" name="Starting Equipment" hidden="false"><description>Every model is equipped with: Avenger shuriken catapult; close combat weapon.</description></rule><rule id="source-000000593-composition" name="Unit Composition" hidden="false"><description>1 Dire Avenger Exarch; 4-9 Dire Avengers</description></rule><rule id="source-000000593-option-0" name="Wargear Option 1" hidden="false"><description>The Dire Avenger Exarch’s Avenger shuriken catapult can be replaced with 1 shuriken pistol and one of the following:- 1 diresword
- 1 power glaive</description></rule><rule id="source-000000593-option-1" name="Wargear Option 2" hidden="false"><description>If this unit’s Dire Avenger Exarch is equipped with 1 Avenger shuriken catapult, it can be equipped with 1 additional Avenger shuriken catapult.</description></rule><rule id="source-000000593-option-2" name="Wargear Option 3" hidden="false"><description>The Dire Avenger Exarch’s shuriken pistol can be replaced with 1 shimmershield.</description></rule><rule id="source-000000593-option-3" name="Wargear Option 4" hidden="false"><description>For every 5 models in this unit, it can have 1 Aspect Shrine token.</description></rule><rule id="source-000000593-points" name="Source Points Table" hidden="false"><description>YOUR UNIT COSTS: 5 models = 70 pts; YOUR UNIT COSTS: 10 models = 140 pts</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="source-000000593-role" name="Infantry" targetId="cat-infantry-11e0" primary="true" hidden="false" /></categoryLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="source-000000593-model-0" name="Dire Avenger Exarch" hidden="false" type="model"><constraints><constraint id="source-000000593-model-0-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="source-000000593-model-0-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="source-000000593-model-0-equipment" name="Wargear (source choices — restrictions shown in Rules)" hidden="false"><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="source-000000593-model-0-weapon-0" name="Avenger shuriken catapult" hidden="false" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint id="source-000000593-model-0-weapon-0-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChil