s unit is within 12" of one or more friendly Aeldari Psyker models, models in this unit have a Leadership characteristic of 6+ and each time a model in this unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000000597-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Wraithguard, Wraith Construct, Infantry, Aeldari</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">Asuryani, , Ynnari</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="source-000000597-starting" name="Starting Equipment" hidden="false"><description>Every model is equipped with: wraithcannon; close combat weapon.</description></rule><rule id="source-000000597-composition" name="Unit Composition" hidden="false"><description>5 Wraithguard</description></rule><rule id="source-000000597-option-0" name="Wargear Option 1" hidden="false"><description>All of the models in this unit can each have their wraithcannon replaced with 1 D-scythe.</description></rule><rule id="source-000000597-points" name="Source Points Table" hidden="false"><description>YOUR UNIT COSTS: 5 models = 145 pts</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="source-000000597-role" name="Infantry" targetId="cat-infantry-11e0" primary="true" hidden="false" /></categoryLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="source-000000597-model-0" name="Wraithguard" hidden="false" type="model"><constraints><constraint id="source-000000597-model-0-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="source-000000597-model-0-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="5" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEn