ished making its attacks against that target unit this phase, each unit struck by a D-rift this phase suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000000622-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Cobra, Aeldari, Vehicle, Fly, Titanic</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">, Asuryani, Ynnari</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="source-000000622-starting" name="Starting Equipment" hidden="false"><description>This model is equipped with: D-impaler; shuriken cannon; wraithbone hull.</description></rule><rule id="source-000000622-composition" name="Unit Composition" hidden="false"><description>1 Cobra</description></rule><rule id="source-000000622-option-0" name="Wargear Option 1" hidden="false"><description>This model’s shuriken cannon can be replaced with one of the following:- 1 Aeldari missile launcher
