vement phase, when an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move within 8" of this unit, if this unit is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to D6".</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000000632-ability-1" name="CORSAIRS" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">If a model from your army with the Leader ability can be attached to a Corsair Voidreavers unit, it can be attached to this unit instead.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000000632-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Aeldari, Corsair Reaver Band, Anhrathe, Grenades, Infantry</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">, Ynnari, Asuryani</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="source-000000632-starting" name="Starting Equipment" hidden="false"><description>Every model is equipped with: brace of pistols; Corsair firearm; close combat weapon.</description></rule><rule id="source-000000632-composition" name="Unit Composition" hidden="false"><description>0-1 Corsair Reaver Felarch; 5-10 Corsair Reavers</description></rule><rule id="source-000000632-option-0" name="Wargear Option 1" hidden="false"><description>Any number of models can each have their Corsair firearm replaced with 1 spar-glaive.</description></rule><rule id="source-000000632-option-1" name="Wargear Option 2" hidden="false"><description>For every 5 models in this unit, 1 model’s Corsair firearm can be replaced with one of the following:- 1 Aeldari missile launcher
- 1 blaster
- 1 dark lance
- 1 flamer
- 1 fusion gun
- 1 shredder
- 1 shuriken cannon
- 1 splinter cannon</description></rule><rule id="source-000000632-option-2" name="Wargear Option 3" hidden="false"><description>The Corsair Reaver Felarch can be equipped with one of the following:- 1 dissonance pistol
- 1 void sabre</description></rule><rule id="source-000000632-points" name="Source Points Table" hidden="false"><description>YOUR UNIT COSTS: 5 models = 125 pts; YOUR UNIT COSTS: 6 models = 150 pts; YOUR UNIT COSTS: 10 models = 250 pts; YOUR UNIT COSTS: 11 models = 275 pts</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="source-000000632-role" name="Infantry" targetId="cat-infantry-11e0" primary="true" hidden="false" /></categoryLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="source-000000632-model-0" name="Corsair Reaver Felarch" hidden="false" type="model"><constraints><constraint id="source-000000632-model-0-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="source-000000632-model-0-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="source-000000632-model-0-equipment" name="Wargear (source choices — restrictions shown in Rules)" hidden="false"><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="source-000000632-model-0-weapon-0" name="Aeldari missile launcher – starshot " hidden="false" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint id="source-000000632-model-0-weapon-0-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="source-000000632-model-0-weapon-0-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="source-000000632-model-0-weapon-0-profile" name="Aeldari missile launcher – starshot " hidden="false" typeId="fd-ranged-type" typeName="Ranged Weapons"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd-rng">48"</characteristic><charac