 your Movement phase, before this model makes a Normal move, it can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the turn, add 2D6" to this model’s Move characteristic and add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of this model’s Solitaire weapons.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002538-ability-6" name="Blur of Movement" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">This model is eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which it Advanced.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002538-ability-7" name="PATH OF DAMNATION" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">This model cannot be your WARLORD.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002538-ability-8" name="Flip Belt" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">Each time the bearer’s unit makes a Normal, Advance, Fall Back or Charge move, ignore any vertical distance when determining the total distance the bearer can be moved during that move.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002538-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Solitaire, Aeldari, Epic Hero, Character, Infantry</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">, Harlequins</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="source-000002538-starting" name="Starting Equipment" hidden="false"><description>This model is equipped with: Solitaire weapons, flip belt.</description></rule><rule id="source-000002538-composition" name="Unit Composition" hidden="false"><description>1 Solitaire – &lt;sp