 typeId="fd-melee-type" typeName="Melee Weapons"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd-mrng">Melee</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="fd-ma">6</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="fd-mws">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="fd-ms">5</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="fd-map">-2</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="fd-md">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="fd-mkw">devastating wounds, precision</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="source-000002543-model-0-weapon-2" name="Asu-var – mythic stance" hidden="false" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint id="source-000002543-model-0-weapon-2-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="source-000002543-model-0-weapon-2-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="source-000002543-model-0-weapon-2-profile" name="Asu-var – mythic stance" hidden="false" typeId="fd-melee-type" typeName="Melee Weapons"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd-mrng">Melee</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="fd-ma">4</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="fd-mws">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="fd-ms">3</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="fd-map">-4</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="fd-md">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="fd-mkw">anti-epic hero 2+, precision</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry></selectionEntries><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="pts-11e0" value="80" /></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="source-aeldari-000002544" name="The Yncarne" hidden="false" type="unit"><profiles><profile id="source-000002544-stats-0" name="The Yncarne" hidden="false" typeId="stat-11e0" typeName="Units"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="m-11e0">10"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="t-11e0">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="sv-11e0">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Inv" typeId="inv-11e0">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="w-11e0">12</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="ld-11e0">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="oc-11e0">3</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002544-ability-4" name="Inevitable Death" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">Once in each of your opponent’s turns, if this model is on the battlefield when another friendly AELDARI unit is destroyed, just after removing the last model in that unit, you can remove this model from the battlefield and set it up as close as possible to where that destroyed model was destroyed and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units. Doing so does not prevent this model from being eligible to move.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002544-ability-5" name="Ethereal Form" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">Each time this model destroys an enemy unit, it regains up to D3 lost wounds.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002544-ability-6" name="AVATAR OF THE WHISPERING GOD" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">If your army includes THE YNCARNE, it cannot include any Epic Hero units (excluding Ynnari units). If your army includes any EPIC HERO units (excluding YNNARI units), it cannot include THE YNCARNE.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002544-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Daemon, The Yncarne, Character, Psyker, Monster, Fly, Aeldari, Epic Hero</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">Ynnari, </characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="source-000002544-starting" name="Starting Equipment" hidden="false"><description>This model is equipped with: swirling soul energy; Vilith-zhar.</description></rule><rule id="source-000002544-composition" name="Unit Composition" hidden="false"><description>1 Yncarne – &lt;span class="kwb"&gt;EPIC&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kwb"&gt;HERO&lt;/span&gt;</description></rule><rule id="source-000002544-points" name="Source Points Table" hidden="false"><description>YOUR UNIT COSTS: 1 model = 230 pts</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="source-000002544-role" name="Monster Epic Hero" targetId="smoke-cat-4" primary="true" hidden="false" /></categoryLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="source-000002544-model-0" name="Yncarne – &lt;span class=&quot;kwb&quot;&gt;EPIC&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;kwb&quot;&gt;HERO&lt;/span&gt;" hidden="false" type="model"><constraints><constraint id="source-000002544-model-0-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="source-000002544-model-0-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="source-000002544-model-0-equipment" name="Wargear (source choices — restrictions shown in Rules)" hidden="false"><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-0" name="Swirling soul energy" hidden="false" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-0-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-0-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-0-profile" name="Swirling soul energy" hidden="false" typeId="fd-ranged-type" typeName="Ranged Weapons"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd-rng">12"</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="fd-rna">D6+3</characteristic><characteristic name="BS" typeId="fd-rbs">-</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="fd-rs">7</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="fd-rap">-1</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="fd-rd">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="fd-rkw">ignores cover, psychic, torrent</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-1" name="Vilith-zhar – strike" hidden="false" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-1-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-1-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-1-profile" name="Vilith-zhar – strike" hidden="false" typeId="fd-melee-type" typeName="Melee Weapons"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd-mrng">Melee</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="fd-ma">5</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="fd-mws">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="fd-ms">12</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="fd-map">-4</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="fd-md">D6+1</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="fd-mkw">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-2" name="Vilith-zhar – sweep" hidden="false" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-2-min" type="min" field="selections" scope="parent" value="0" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /><constraint id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-2-max" type="max" field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" shared="true" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="source-000002544-model-0-weapon-2-profile" name="Vilith-zhar – sweep" hidden="false" typeId="fd-melee-type" typeName="Melee Weapons"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="fd-mrng">Melee</characteristic><characteristic name="A" typeId="fd-ma">10</characteristic><characteristic name="WS" typeId="fd-mws">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="fd-ms">6</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="fd-map">-4</characteristic><characteristic name="D" typeId="fd-md">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="fd-mkw">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups></selectionEntry></selectionEntries><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="pts-11e0" value="230" /></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="source-aeldari-000002759" name="Autarch Wayleaper" hidden="false" type="unit"><profiles><profile id="source-000002759-stats-0" name="Autarch Wayleaper" hidden="false" typeId="stat-11e0" typeName="Units"><characteristics><characteristic name="M" typeId="m-11e0">14"</characteristic><characteristic name="T" typeId="t-11e0">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Sv" typeId="sv-11e0">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Inv" typeId="inv-11e0">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="W" typeId="w-11e0">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Ld" typeId="ld-11e0">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="OC" typeId="oc-11e0">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002759-ability-3" name="Indomitable Strength of Will" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">While this model is leading a unit, each time you spend a Battle Focus token to enable that unit to perform an Agile Manoeuvre, roll one D6: on a 3+, you gain 1 Battle Focus token.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002759-ability-4" name="Path of Command" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">Once per battle round, one model from your army with this ability can use it when its unit is targeted with a Stratagem. If it does, reduce the CP cost of that usage of that Stratagem by 1CP.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000002759-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Infantry, Grenades, Character, Fly, Aeldari, Jump Pack, Autarch Wayleaper</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">, Asuryani, Ynnari</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="source-000002759-starting" name="Starting Equipment" hidden="false"><description>This model is equipped with: shuriken pistol; star glaive.</description></rule><rule id="source-000002759-composition" name="Unit Composition" hidden="false"><description>1 Autarch Wayleaper</description></rule><rule id="source-000002759-option-0" name="Wargear Option 1" hidden="false"><description>This model’s shuriken pistol can be replaced with one of the following:- 1 death spinner
- 1 Dragon fusion gun
- 1 Dragon fusion pistol
- 1 Reaper launcher</description></rule><rule id="source-000002759-option-1" name="Wargear Option 2" hidden="false"><description>This model’s star glaive can be replaced with one of the following:- 1 Banshee blade
