 Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000003916-ability-3" name="Phantasm Grenade Launcher" hidden="false" typeId="ability-11e0" typeName="Abilities"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="description-11e0">The bearer’s unit has the GRENADES keyword.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="source-000003916-keywords" name="Keywords" hidden="false" typeId="keywords-11e0" typeName="Keywords"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="unit-keywords-11e0">Battleline, Infantry, Kabalite Warriors, Aeldari</characteristic><characteristic name="Faction Keywords" typeId="faction-keywords-11e0">Ynnari, </characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><rules><rule id="source-000003916-starting" name="Starting Equipment" hidden="false"><description>Every model is equipped with: splinter rifle; close combat weapon.</description></rule><rule id="source-000003916-composition" name="Unit Composition" hidden="false"><description>1 Sybarite; 9 Kabalite Warriors</description></rule><rule id="source-000003916-option-0" name="Wargear Option 1" hidden="false"><description>The Sybarite’s close combat weapon can be replaced with 1 Sybarite weapon.</description></rule><rule id="source-000003916-option-1" name="Wargear Option 2" hidden="false"><description>The Sybarite can be equipped with 1 phantasm grenade launcher.</description></rule><rule id="source-000003916-option-2" name="Wargear Option 3" hidden="false"><description>The Sybarite’s splinter rifle can be replaced with one of the following:- 1 blast pistol
